<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35423" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεργ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to act upon, acting upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κινητοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					202a17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>productive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					12.35.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>active,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1220b3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοπάθεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.28.6
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				<i>actively,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.223
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				293
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ῥῆμα</span> an <i>active</i>
			verb, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Amm.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>; of Nouns, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				161.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφορά, διάθεσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				150.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				210.19
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				276.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.9
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>efficacious, stimulating,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				2.33.4
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			).</div>
